                            <DTCS>
                                <DTC ID="DTCP0B22F6" OID="31b99e77-21b8-4756-ba03-4dac8e6eb980">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCP0B22F6</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>729846</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>P0B22F6</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_142253460">0B22F6</TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_392746800">service immediately</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_703038262">1. Check whether the vehicle CAN network can send and receive data normally
2. Check if the RAC harness is connected correctly
3. Check if the RAC is normal
If it is confirmed to be an RAC failure, please replace the RAC.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_2129130747">1. 2s after IG ON
2. Vehicle voltage is between 9v and 16v</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1923579953">If active: DTC monitor will be enabled only when related function is active</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1756116061">When the "sending error counter " exceeds 255 in accumulated value, the node enters the Bus-off state.
If the NBusOffCount enters the Bus Off state several times, the Bus Off Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC) shall be recorded.
NBusOffCount = 3</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1092493083">Recover from bus off,and send a message successfully.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1833380640">Record DTC; function degradation.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_186490916">40</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_618249445">Physical Short of CAN Line</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_351894603">LCD Display not updated.</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                            </DTCS>
                        </DTC-DOP>
                    </DTC-DOPS>
